730},{"id":"zhouyu-e-p024a","title":"吕蒙令虞翻书说士仁降","accounts":[{"id":"zhouyu-e-p024a-account","label":"《吴书》","text":"吕蒙令虞翻书说士仁降","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p024a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-meng","role":"遣说","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p024a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"说降","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p024a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0056","role":"归降","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p024a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"取公安南郡时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-p024a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-p024a-q","source_order":[54,445,"P024a"],"order":9738}],"persons":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0056","name":"士仁","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o090","guanzhang-q-o009","wuzhu-q-o035","dengzhang-q-1e29923eddba0e84184e"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhouyu-m-o090-zhouyu-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o090"]},{"id":"zhouyu-m-p024-zhouyu-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-p024"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-o009-zhouyu-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o009"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-o010-zhouyu-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o010"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o035-zhouyu-p0056","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o035"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-8d07e968b82a6eee26dc","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-3bc18ddf9d07d9917101","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，即引兵西袭公安、江陵。羽遂见擒","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":164,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-b192fa995ef8ee2a38da","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-ffe3df8382e2c02cd193","layer":"original","quote":"权军至，得其二城，羽乃破败","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":272,"end":285,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-1e29923eddba0e84184e","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-6b4b60ba735e8e57d1e9","layer":"original","quote":"住公安，统属关羽。与羽有隙，叛迎孙权","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-70854b5f7653ecd1186b","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-51d41a232534f63df917","layer":"original","quote":"孙权袭羽，遂入吴","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":362,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-f0266495f0ace536ff6e","layer":"original","quote":"又南郡太守麋芳在江陵，将军（傅）士仁屯公安；素皆嫌羽自轻己。羽之出军，芳、仁供给军资，不悉相救〖7〗；羽言“还当治之”，芳、仁咸怀惧不安。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o010a-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-d7695050b7ab7c9718d1","layer":"original","quote":"于是权阴诱芳、仁，芳、仁使人迎权。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o009","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-f0266495f0ace536ff6e","layer":"original","quote":"先是，权遣使为子索羽女〖6〗。羽骂辱其使，不许婚；权大怒。﹝一﹞又南郡太守麋芳在江陵，将军（傅）士仁屯公安；素皆嫌羽自轻己。羽之出军，芳、仁供给军资，不悉相救〖7〗；羽言“还当治之”，芳、仁咸怀惧不安。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":36,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o010","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-d7695050b7ab7c9718d1","layer":"original","quote":"于是权阴诱芳、仁，芳、仁使人迎权。而曹公遣徐晃救曹仁，﹝二﹞羽不能克，引军退还。权已据江陵，尽虏羽士众妻子，羽军遂散。权遣将逆击羽，斩羽及子平于临沮〖8〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83834db77f87d5f2c6c1","layer":"original","quote":"闰月〖12〗，权征羽。先遣吕蒙袭公安，获将军士仁〖13〗；蒙到南郡，南郡太守麋芳以城降〖14〗。蒙据江陵，抚其老弱，释于禁之囚。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。权内惮羽，外欲以为己功；笺与曹公〖10〗，乞以讨羽自效〖11〗。曹公且欲使羽与权相持以斗之，驿传权书；使曹仁以弩射示羽，羽犹豫不能去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o035","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83834db77f87d5f2c6c1","layer":"original","quote":"闰月〖12〗，权征羽。先遣吕蒙袭公安，获将军士仁〖13〗；蒙到南郡，南郡太守麋芳以城降〖14〗。蒙据江陵，抚其老弱，释于禁之囚。陆逊别取宜都〖15〗，获秭归、枝江、夷道〖16〗；还屯夷陵，守峡口以备蜀〖17〗。关羽还当阳〖18〗，西保麦城〖19〗。权使诱之。羽伪降，立幡旗为象人于城上〖20〗，因遁走；兵皆解散，尚十余骑。权先使朱然、潘璋断其径路〖21〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xumisun-q-002147a918bb5bc29017","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-4f88009456c4b05fd414","layer":"original","quote":"叛迎孙权，羽因覆败","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":177,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-202570869e3cbb43dc7f","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-27e79ab5543b5b176ad3","layer":"original","quote":"南郡太守麋芳开城出降","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-43c3850a9ef831e590b9","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-36fc85af01c76df52293","layer":"original","quote":"权至，释之，请与相见","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o090b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-9c7294aa684e18a71d04","layer":"original","quote":"遂到南郡，士仁、麋芳皆降〖20〗。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":412,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":77,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-p024a-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-2f7b73dab32dcad3714e","layer":"pei","quote":"将军士仁，在公安拒守，蒙令虞翻说之。翻至城门，谓守者曰：‘吾欲与汝将军语。’仁不肯相见。乃为书曰：‘明者防祸于未萌，智者图患于将来；知得知失，可与为人；知存知亡，足别吉凶。大军之行，斥候不及施，烽火不及举；此非天命，必有内应。将军不先见时，时至又不应之；独守萦带之城而不降，死战则毁宗灭祀，为天下讥笑。吕虎威欲径到南郡，断绝陆道；生路一塞，按其地形，将军为在箕舌上耳。奔走不得免，降则失义：窃为将军不安。幸熟思焉！’仁得书，流涕而降。","attribution":"《吴书》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7b0f2a0db10a2242c208","start":10,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o090","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-9c7294aa684e18a71d04","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，遂行。先遣蒙在前，蒙至寻阳，尽伏其精兵}~中〖17〗，使白衣摇橹〖18〗，作商贾人服，昼夜兼行。至羽所置江边屯候〖19〗，尽收缚之，是故羽不闻知。遂到南郡，士仁、麋芳皆降〖20〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":412,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p024","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-2f7b73dab32dcad3714e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《吴书》曰：“将军士仁，在公安拒守，蒙令虞翻说之。翻至城门，谓守者曰：‘吾欲与汝将军语。’仁不肯相见。乃为书曰：‘明者防祸于未萌，智者图患于将来；知得知失，可与为人；知存知亡，足别吉凶。大军之行，斥候不及施，烽火不及举；此非天命，必有内应。将军不先见时，时至又不应之；独守萦带之城而不降，死战则毁宗灭祀，为天下讥笑。吕虎威欲径到南郡，断绝陆道；生路一塞，按其地形，将军为在箕舌上耳。奔走不得免，降则失义：窃为将军不安。幸熟思焉！’仁得书，流涕而降。翻谓蒙曰：‘此谲兵也！当将仁行，留兵备城。’遂将仁至南郡。南郡太守麋芳城守，蒙以仁示之，遂降。”","attribution":"《吴书》","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7b0f2a0db10a2242c208","start":0,"end":275,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
